{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S07、S11把对方可能需要陪伴进一步说成互相依靠、彼此需要，还增加了“忽然一紧”等心理变化，人物动机有些被推重，Y在这方面更克制准确。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听音乐边扫屏幕的观众，X的短句切分和关键词加亮让我能迅速抓住每段在讲什么，不必读完一整段才能明白重点；感受词按音乐段落出现，也让我有余力选择性地看细节。X在音乐质感、情绪细微变化和画面联想上明显更具体，但Y的完整叙述更自然地交代了人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕、又为什么逐渐改变，因此在心理因果和整体叙事连贯性上Y略胜。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "085a08e6-1ec8-43ae-98d2-390ef7f5b748", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T214053396454Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:42:17.378893+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cea179282ed5522ae0fba795398e6fdcbf69ef92d9196bc92257bfecb394bff0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt